# quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987 — «Problem with Plasma» · in play order
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: レヴナンツトールのアガンボルドは、冒険者に協力してほしいようだ。
#. de: Aganbold sucht jemanden für eine kribbelige Angelegenheit.
#. fr: Aganbold semble survolté, comme s'il voulait demander de l'aide.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "Everyone has need of an adventurer sometimes, even among the brethren, and Aganbold has a most shocking request."
msgstr ""

#. ja: アガンボルドが<sheet EventItem 2000756 0>を欲しがっている。「<sheet BNpcName 46 0>」を討伐し「<sheet EventItem 2000757 0>」を3つ手に入れよう。
#. de: Der Abenteurer Aganbold benötigt <noun-de EventItem 5 2000756 1 4 1>. Strecke <noun-de BNpcName 5 46 2 4 1> nieder und besorge zuerst einmal drei <noun-de EventItem 5 2000757 2 4 1>.
#. fr: Aganbold vous a demandé de lui apporter <noun-fr EventItem 1 2000756 1 1>. Commencez d'abord par obtenir trois <noun-fr EventItem 12 2000757 2 1> sur ces créatures.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_SEQ_01:1"
msgid "Aganbold has a need of catalytic ectoplasm for reasons unknown, or possibly unmentionable. Slay plasmoids and obtain three samples of catalytic plasma."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet EventItem 2000757 0>を手に入れることができた。早霜峠の「<sheet EObj 2002203 0>」3ヶ所に「<sheet EventItem 2000757 0>」を撒こう。
#. de: Du hast genug <noun-de EventItem 5 2000757 2 4 1> besorgt. Verstreue deine Beute an drei Stellen <noun-de EObj 2 2002203 1 2 1> auf dem Frühen Frost.
#. fr: Dispersez les <noun-fr EventItem 12 2000757 2 1> près de trois <noun-fr EObj 12 2002203 2 1> de Hâtegel.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_SEQ_02:1"
msgid "You successfully collect the plasma. Is that acrid taste in your mouth guilt, or are you just happy to see so many crystals? Spread the plasma on the large crystallized tree in Rathefrost."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet EventItem 2000757 0>を撒き終わった。早霜峠の「<sheet EObj 2002451 0>」で待機し、「<sheet BNpcName 1996 0>」を討伐しよう。
#. de: Gute Arbeit, die Köder sind ausgelegt. Warte jetzt am <noun-de EObj 5 2002451 1 3 1> auf dem Frühen Frost und erschlage <noun-de BNpcName 1 1996 1 4 1>.
#. fr: Cachez-vous à l'endroit indiqué, attendez qu'<noun-fr BNpcName 1 1996 1 1> fasse son apparition, et abattez-l<if "<sheet BNpcName 1996 6>">a<else>e</if><nbsp>!
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_SEQ_03:1"
msgid "The plasma is spread, and now your lurking begins. When the ectoplasm appears, attack it without provocation."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet EventItem 2000756 0>を無事、手に入れることができた。レヴナンツトールの「アガンボルド」に「<sheet EventItem 2000756 0>」を渡そう。
#. de: Du hast <noun-de EventItem 2 2000756 1 4 1> ergattert. Bringe es zu Aganbold.
#. fr: Vous avez obtenu <noun-fr EventItem 2 2000756 1 1> demandé<if "<sheet EventItem 2000756 6>">e</if> par Aganbold. Allez lui remettre.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_SEQ_04:1"
msgid "At long last, you have the catalytic ectoplasm. The metallic taste in your mouth has gone, and the ectoplasm in your hands sends up a pleasant hum like a purring kitten. Deliver it to Aganbold."
msgstr ""

#. ja: アガンボルドに<sheet EventItem 2000756 0>を渡すことができた。感電しやすい体質のアガンボルドは、学者から雷を帯びた<sheet EventItem 2000756 0>の入手を依頼されて困っていたらしい。
#. de: Aganbold war überaus glücklich, dass du ihm die <i>hochspannende</i> Arbeit abgenommen hast. Der Gute ist nämlich empfindlich für Stromschläge.
#. fr: Aganbold vous a révélé que son organisme a tendance à concentrer l'électricité, et qu'un chercheur lui avait demandé de lui obtenir <noun-fr EventItem 1 2000756 1 1> chargé<if "<sheet EventItem 2000756 6>">e</if> d'énergie de la foudre.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_SEQ_05:1"
msgid "In Aganbold's hands, the ectoplasm is less a contented cat and more a vexed porcupine. Behind the cheerful mien, Aganbold has a secret sorrow─he is averse to lightning, but favored by learned customers with galvanic interests..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName 46 0>から<sheet EventItem 2000757 0>を入手
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de EventItem 5 2000757 2 4 1></capitalize> von <noun-de BNpcName 5 46 2 3 1> besorgen
#. fr: Abattre des <noun-fr BNpcName 12 46 2 1> et obtenir des <noun-fr EventItem 12 2000757 2 1>
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Collect samples of catalytic plasma from plasmoids."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 結晶化した樹に<sheet EventItem 2000757 0>を使う
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de EventItem 5 2000757 2 4 1></capitalize> am kristallisierten Baum benutzen
#. fr: Utiliser <noun-fr EventItem 2 2000757 2 1> sur les arbres cristallisés
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_TODO_01:1"
msgid "Spread the catalytic plasma on the crystallized bark."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet EObj 2002451 0>で待機し<sheet BNpcName 1996 0>を討伐
#. de: Am <noun-de EObj 5 2002451 1 3 1> warten und <noun-de BNpcName 5 1996 1 4 1> besiegen
#. fr: Attendre à l'endroit indiqué et abattre <noun-fr BNpcName 2 1996 1 1>
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_TODO_02:1"
msgid "Lurk at the ambush point, and slay the ectoplasm."
msgstr ""

#. ja: アガンボルドに<sheet EventItem 2000756 0>を渡す
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de EventItem 5 2000756 1 4 1></capitalize> zu Aganbold bringen
#. fr: Donner <noun-fr EventItem 2 2000756 1 1> à Aganbold
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_TODO_03:1"
msgid "Deliver the catalytic ectoplasm to Aganbold."
msgstr ""

#. ja: そこの同業者、俺の頼みを聞いていかねぇか。<br>ちっと「<sheet EventItem 2000756 0>」が必要なんだが、<br>手を貸してほしいんだ。
#. de: He, <if $gn4>Kollejin<else>Kolleje</if>! Kannste mir vielleicht 'nen Jefallen tun? Ick brauch nämlich 'n bisschen <noun-de EventItem 5 2000756 1 4 1>.
#. fr: Dis, tu as déjà vu ces créatures qu'on appelle <noun-fr BNpcName 12 46 2 1><nbsp>?
#. speaker: AGANBOLD
#. macro: <if $gn4>Sister<else>Brother</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_AGANBOLD_000_000:1"
msgid "<if $gn4>Sister<else>Brother</if> adventurer, hear me out. I need me a sample of catalytic ectoplasm, but I'm not having much luck."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 手に入れる方法はこうだ……。<br>まず、早霜峠で「<sheet BNpcName 46 0>」って魔物を倒して、<br>「<sheet EventItem 2000757 0>」を手に入れる。
#. de: Is ooch janz einfach! Brauchst bloß zum Frühen Frost zu jehn, da 'n paar <noun-de BNpcName 5 46 2 4 1> vermöbeln und dir <noun-de EventItem 5 2000757 2 4 1> zu besorjen.
#. fr: Tu sais donc qu'on peut obtenir des catalyseurs en les abattant, n'est-ce pas<nbsp>?
#. speaker: AGANBOLD
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_AGANBOLD_000_001:1"
msgid "It's no great shakes, mind you. First, you go to Rathefrost, slay yourself some plasmoids, then collect three samples of catalytic plasma."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 次に、それを結晶化した樹に撒いて、しばらく待つと……<br><sheet EventItem 2000757 0>の持つ雷気に反応して、<br>結晶化した樹が雷を帯びるようになる。
#. de: Dann streuste dit Zeuch auf den kristallisierten Baum, der uuf den Elektrokram in <noun-de EventItem 2 2000757 2 3 1> reajiert und anfangen sollte, Blitze zu versprühen.
#. fr: Ce que tu ignores pro<shy>ba<shy>ble<shy>ment, c'est que si tu disperses ça près des arbres cristallisés à Hâtegel, eh bien, il est possible de faire venir <noun-fr BNpcName 1 1996 1 1>, un truc très im<shy>pres<shy>sion<shy>nant<nbsp>!
#. speaker: AGANBOLD
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_AGANBOLD_000_002:1"
msgid "Douse the large crystallized tree with that, wait a spell, and the bark'll start crackling from the lightning that surges in the plasma."
msgstr ""

#. ja: するとどうだ、狙われているとも知らずに、<br>「<sheet BNpcName 1996 0>」が寄ってくるんだ！<br>そいつを倒せば、目的の品が手に入るってわけさ。
#. de: Davon anjelockt wird sich nach kurzer Zeit 'n <noun-de BNpcName 5 1996 1 1 1> zeigen, dem de dit Endprodukt bitte mit een paar freundlichen Schläjen entlockst. Kinderleicht, wa? Ick würd's meinen eijenen Sohn machen lassen, wenn der nich gerade mit seinem Magitek-Baukasten so beschäftigt wäre. 
#. fr: Bien sûr, <if "<sheet BNpcName 1996 6>">elle<else>il</if> t'attaquera sûrement, mais par expérience, je peux te dire que ces créatures ne sont pas si coriaces.
#. speaker: AGANBOLD
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_AGANBOLD_000_003:1"
msgid "After that, it's like gardening on a goobbue─the ectoplasm comes scampering over without a care in the world. Hit that right quick, and you've got yourself some catalytic ectoplasm."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……ほ、欲しい理由……だと？<br>あーその、細かいことはいいじゃないか。<br>それじゃあ、よろしく頼んだぜ！
#. de: Warum ick mir dit Zeuch nich selbst besorje? Boah, du stellst Frajen! Hast anscheinend noch nich jenuch Routine jesammelt, wa?
#. fr: En fait, si je te raconte tout ceci, c'est parce que je voudrais que tu tues un de ces monstres et que tu me rapportes <noun-fr EventItem 1 2000756 1 1>. Je t'expliquerai pourquoi après.
#. speaker: AGANBOLD
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <if $gn4>sister<else>brother</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_AGANBOLD_000_004:1"
msgid "Why do I want <i>you</i> to get it? Come now, <if $gn4>sister<else>brother</if>, let's not go prying into the unmentionables drawer! All in good time, all in good time."
msgstr ""

#. ja: お、おう、持ってきたかよ。<br>そうっと渡せよな、そうっと……。
#. de: Und, haste dit Zeuch? Dann ma nüscht wie her damit!
#. fr: Alors<nbsp>? Tu m'as rapporté ce que je t'ai demandé...<nbsp>?
#. speaker: AGANBOLD
#. macro: <if $gn4>sister<else>brother</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_AGANBOLD_000_040:1"
msgid "Got the little shocker? That's what I call an adventurer! You're a fearless one, <if $gn4>sister<else>brother</if>!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 痛ってええええぇぇぇぇっっ！！<br>今、バチッと来た、バチッと！
#. de: Argh! \<britzel> ... Haste jesehen? Die Haare standen mir zu Berje, so jeladen is dit!
#. fr: Ouuuuiiiiille<nbsp>! Aïe<nbsp>! Ouille...<nbsp>! Raaah, la vache<nbsp>! Qu'est-ce que ça fait mal<nbsp>!
#. speaker: AGANBOLD
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_AGANBOLD_000_045:1"
msgid "Ooowww, swivin' sons of─! Seven hells for seven brothers, that hurts like a troll marryin' my daughter!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……そうさ、これが理由ってやつだよ。<br>俺はどうも体に雷を溜めこむ性質らしくてな。<br>寒いとこや雷を帯びたとこに行くと、すぐ感電しちまうんだ。
#. de: Und dit is ooch jenau der Grund, warum ick dit nich selbst besorjen kann. Ick bin nämlich 'n juter Leiter, wie's scheint. Die Jarlear wollten mich sojar mal als Überbrückungskabel für ihre Magitek-Kampf<shy>maschinen benutzen! Is 'n Unding, wat?
#. fr: En fait, mon corps a tendance à concentrer l'électricité statique, et donc quand je vais dans un endroit où il fait froid ou qu'il y a beaucoup d'énergie de la foudre, je prends des coups de jus comme ça.
#. speaker: AGANBOLD
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_AGANBOLD_000_046:1"
msgid "\\<sigh> Now you see why <i>I</i> was none too keen on getting the bugger myself. I don't know what it is, but I always end up getting shocked. Maybe I'm lightning-aspected...or straight lightning-<i>disrespected</i>, even."
msgstr ""

#. ja: なのに、学者先生から依頼された仕事が、<br>雷を帯びた「<sheet EventItem 2000756 0>」の入手でさぁ。<br>お前にゃ悪いが、手を借りたってわけさ……。
#. de: Kannst dir jetzt sicher vorstellen, wie ick Panik jeschoben hab, als ick den Ooftrach mit dem Plasma bekam. Echt dufte, dass de mir jeholfen hast!
#. fr: Autant te dire que ce n'est pas drôle tous les jours... mais l'autre fois, un chercheur m'a demandé de lui obtenir un catalyseur chargé du pouvoir de la foudre. C'est pour ça que je t'ai demandé ton aide. Merci donc.
#. speaker: AGANBOLD
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_AGANBOLD_000_047:1"
msgid "Just my luck that I keep getting commissions from these learned types, and about half of them and half of the rest are studying lightning. I should give up adventuring and be an agent, at this rate."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 敵の気配を感じた！！
#. de: Du spürst eine feindliche Präsenz!
#. fr: Vous ressentez une présence hostile<nbsp>!
#. kind: other
msgctxt "quest/009/GaiUsc412_00987:TEXT_GAIUSC412_00987_POP_MESSAGE_000:1"
msgid "The hair begins to rise on your arms!"
msgstr ""
